   242	We need one specialization lemma.  Let `z` be a smooth point of `B_i`, let
   243	`y` lie on its dominating ramification divisor `E_i`, and choose regular
   244	parameters `(p,q)` at `z`, with `p=0` defining `B_i`.  The local ring
