   252	## 7. Firewalls
   253	
   254	- Flag, place, and series remain distinct: infinite places are Chau places of components, not cv flags, and not cover series of `pi`.
   255	- No exit-price assertion is made. Promoted prices are consumed without a `charge_basis` line.
   256	- `REPRESENTATIVE` trees (T2, T3path, T3star, T3split) are the complete forest list on `m<=3`, not a sample of an infinite family of trees. The infinite family is `n22`, named as such.
