+### 4.2 The report's own estimate kills every split `T31` row
+
+**Verdict: REFUTED.** Accept for the moment charged line 80's formula and cap
+
+```text
+e(T31)=h31-sigma,       sigma<=n4+(m-h).
+```
+
+Then exactly as charged line 83 states,
+
+```text
