+## 6. Lemma 2.3 and the unbounded parameter
+
+### 6.1 Conditional summation
+
+**Verdict: CONFIRMED WITH A NOTATIONAL CORRECTION.** Assume (D1)--(D4), the generic identity (2.3) for every `B_i`, and the companion bounds
+
+```text
